OL,3,APolice officers lied about searches
OL,4,Aconnected to fatal crash, hearing told
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo police officers lied about carrying
OL,7,Fout missing person searches at the
OL,8,Fhomes of two young women who were
OL,9,Finvolved in a triple fatal crash, a
OL,10,Fpolice misconduct hearing has heard.
OL,12,FPC Richard Hardwick and PC Lauren
OL,13,FLivingstone face gross misconduct
OL,14,Fallegations over their actions before a
OL,15,Fcar carrying five people was found
OL,16,Fcrashed two days later in a woodland in
OL,17,FSt Mellons, Cardiff, in 2023.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
