OL,3,APolice officers lied about searches
OL,4,Aconnected to fatal crash, hearing told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hearing in Newport was told they
OL,7,Fwere "dishonest" in official logs and
OL,8,Fto a senior officer by claiming
OL,9,Fsearches of the homes of Eve Smith, who
OL,10,Fdied, and Sophie Russon had been
OL,11,Fcarried out.
OL,13,FThe two serving Gwent officers attended
OL,14,Fthe hearing and denied all allegations
OL,15,Fagainst them.
